      "problem": "Calculate ${lim}_{x\\to (-2)}\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}-2x}.$",
      "worked_solution": "We substitute $x=-2$ into the expression, and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to (-2)}\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}-2x} & =\\sqrt[3]{(-2)^{2}-2(-2)} \\\\  & =\\sqrt[3]{8} \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
